{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47544","headline":"七言 五十三 · 吕岩","name":"七言 五十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲来掉臂入天门，拂袂徐徐撮彩云。\n无语下窥黄谷子，破颜平揖紫霞君。\n拟登瑶殿参金母，回访瀛洲看日轮。\n恰值嫦娥排宴会，瑶浆新熟味氤氲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47544.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47544","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}